    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis three bedroom detached is set on its own private, mature site just a ten minute walk from the renowned Rosslare Strand. Offering both privacy and convenience, it is ideally suited as a holiday retreat or a comfortable permanent residence.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a living room, a kitchen/dining area, three well proportioned bedrooms with the master ensuite, a main bathroom and a guest w.c. \nTo the rear, the property boasts a large private garden with excellent potential. There is scope to extend the existing home or, possibly develop an additional dwelling within the grounds subject to the relevant planning permission. \n\nRosslare Strand is one of Wexford's most popular addresses, attracting families and homeowners seeking a vibrant coastal lifestyle. A wide range of local amenities are within easy walking distance, including supermarkets, a golf course, pubs and national school to name but a few. The area is also home to two hotels, including the award winning Kelly's Resort Hotel. \n\nThis property offers a rare opportunity to enjoy coastal living in a peaceful setting while remaining close to all that Rosslare Strand has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.92m x 2.27m approx.\nWith doors to:\n\nLiving Room - 5.14m x 3.94m\nWith solid fuel stove and double doors to side patio area.\n\nKitchen - 3.5m x 3.19m\nWith fitted kitchen and door to side patio area.\n\nGuest w.c. - \nWith w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBathroom - 2.86m x 2.35m\nWith w.c., w.h.b., bath and shower.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 5.75m x 3.68m\nWith built in wardrobes, dressing area and door to ensuite.\n\nEnsuite - 2.91m x 1.05m\nWith w.c., w.h.b. and shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.04m x 2.85m\nWith built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.95m x 2.82m\n\n\n"
      },
